    "_fields": {
      "body": [
        {
          "_type": "Expr",
          "_fields": {
            "value": {
              "_type": "Constant",
              "_fields": {
                "value": "\nHop 4: Staging and Sanitization - HIGH-SIGNAL OVERWRITE\n\nThis hop is a deterministic \"data integrity\" layer. It cleans, validates,\nand finalizes the creative output from HOP-3 before it can be validated\nor rendered.\n\nIts responsibilities are:\n1.  Remove all AI/LLM generation artifacts (e.g., \"Certainly!\", markdown).\n2.  Perform structural unification (e.g., split string-based lists into List[str]).\n3.  Sanitize any remaining placeholders (e.g., \"[Insert Metric]\").\n4.  Inject per-section metadata (word counts, bullet counts) for granular\n    validation in HOP-5.\n5.  Create and lock the final ImmutableStagingBuffer.\n",
                "kind": "None"
              },
              "_lineno": 2,
              "_col_offset": 0
            }
          },
          "_lineno": 2,
          "_col_offset": 0
        },
